WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.669
-Thank you very much, everybody.
Welcome.

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:06.806
Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:08.841
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:12.111
Well, guys, it's been
a pretty epic 24 hours.

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:14.847
Joe Biden was certified
as our next president.

00:00:14.847 --> 00:00:16.315
Several --

00:00:16.315 --> 00:00:17.983
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.983 --> 00:00:20.620
Several staffers have resigned
from the White House.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:23.122
Trump's social media accounts
were banned.

00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:26.359
And yet, compared to yesterday,
it's a slow news day.

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:28.060
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:30.296
I'm still trying to
process everything.

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:33.499
Did anyone else have a tough
time calming down last night?

00:00:33.499 --> 00:00:35.067
It wasn't easy falling asleep.

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:37.136
I tried listening
to my mediation app,

00:00:37.136 --> 00:00:39.071
but the guy leading the session
was just chanting,

00:00:39.071 --> 00:00:41.441
"25th Amendment,
25th Amendment."

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:43.442
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.442 --> 00:00:44.710
Honestly, don't you just wish

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:46.145
we could go back to
the good old days,

00:00:46.145 --> 00:00:48.247
where all we had to worry about
was a global pandemic

00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:49.949
and murder hornets?

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:54.087
2021 feels like the end
of a "Scooby-Doo" episode

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:55.688
where we pull off its mask
to reveal

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:57.490
it's been 2020 all along.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:58.658
It's like...

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:00.860
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.795
God, I miss 2020.

00:01:02.795 --> 00:01:04.464
Things are so crazy.

00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:07.000
Today, Mexico was like, "If you
need a wall around your Capitol,

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.802
we'll pay for it."

00:01:11.904 --> 00:01:13.406
Meanwhile,
some of the rioters claimed

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:15.975
they didn't realize
that they were trespassing.

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:17.777
Sadly, not many people
were charged

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:19.912
because the police said
it was "all white."

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:22.282
[ Audience groans ]

00:01:22.282 --> 00:01:24.883
I think if there's anything
to be learned from yesterday,

00:01:24.883 --> 00:01:27.687
it's that Merrick Garland
can't have one fun day.

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:31.357
I mean, first, his Supreme Court
nomination gets blocked,

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:34.059
then he gets a new job,
and a riot happens.

00:01:34.059 --> 00:01:36.529
Seriously, what did this guy do
in a previous life,

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:38.764
kick over strollers?

00:01:38.764 --> 00:01:41.401
Anyway, late last night,
Congress reconvened

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:45.204 line:0%
and completed the certification
of the Electoral College votes.

00:01:45.204 --> 00:01:47.807
[ Applause ]

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:49.208
Yeah.

00:01:49.208 --> 00:01:50.543
And all jokes aside,

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:52.846
I thought it was so cool
that Congress came back

00:01:52.846 --> 00:01:54.780
and didn't let those losers win.

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:57.149
I thought it was a pretty
powerful message to send.

00:01:57.149 --> 00:01:58.918
But because of all the chaos,

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:01.621
Pence officially affirmed
Biden's victory

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:04.157
at 3:45 in the morning.

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:06.192
Yep.
After the win was certified,

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:07.927
Biden was like, "Gee, thanks.

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:10.163
Can't wait to take over
this paradise."

00:02:10.163 --> 00:02:12.198
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:14.267
That's right, Congress
worked through the night

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:17.437
and confirmed Biden's victory
around 4:00 a.m.

00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:19.105
Yeah, we recognized the election

00:02:19.105 --> 00:02:21.106
of the world's
most powerful person

00:02:21.106 --> 00:02:23.676
when cable channels
were showing infomercials.

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:27.580
Pence was like, "I hereby
declare Joe Biden as the winner.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.249
And now, stay tuned
for an infomercial

00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:31.584
for Marie Osmond's BodyGym."

00:02:31.584 --> 00:02:33.653
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:36.523
♪♪

00:02:36.523 --> 00:02:38.591
"You don't even feel like
you're sweating."

00:02:39.892 --> 00:02:41.060
Today, for the first time,

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.728
President Trump
finally acknowledged

00:02:42.728 --> 00:02:45.264
that there will be an
orderly transition of power

00:02:45.264 --> 00:02:46.965
on January 20th.

00:02:46.965 --> 00:02:49.402
When Trump says there will be
an orderly transition,

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:52.704
he means an orderly
is gonna have to drag him
out the front door.

00:02:52.704 --> 00:02:55.140
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:57.143
"Get him out of here!"

00:02:57.143 --> 00:03:00.312
The reason one of Trump's aides
tweeted that message for him

00:03:00.312 --> 00:03:02.248
is because
the President was banned

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:04.384
from all of
his social media accounts,

00:03:04.384 --> 00:03:08.521
including Twitter, Facebook,
Instagram, and even Snapchat.

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:12.492
In other news, guess who doesn't
want to ban TikTok anymore?

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:14.927
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.927 --> 00:03:17.063
Love TikTok.

00:03:17.063 --> 00:03:19.866
Without Twitter, it was pretty
embarrassing for Trump.

00:03:19.866 --> 00:03:21.100
He was walking around
the West Wing

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:23.002
with a piece of paper
and a heart stamp,

00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:25.170
yelling, "Like this!
Like this! Like this!

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:27.173
Like this! Like this!"

00:03:27.173 --> 00:03:28.708
Since yesterday's riot,

00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:31.010 line:0%
resignations have poured in
at the White House,

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:33.445 line:0%
and sources expect
they'll keep coming.

00:03:33.445 --> 00:03:35.448
Although, resigning
with two weeks left

00:03:35.448 --> 00:03:37.549
feels less like some moral stand

00:03:37.549 --> 00:03:39.786
and more like leaving early
to beat traffic.

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:42.154
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.154 --> 00:03:44.824
My question is, how do you
put in your two weeks' notice

00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:47.260
when your job ends
in less than two weeks?

00:03:48.828 --> 00:03:50.997
I read that, according to
his closest allies,

00:03:50.997 --> 00:03:53.733
Trump is, quote,
"mentally unreachable,"

00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:55.034
while another source believes

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:57.603
the President
is "out of his mind."

00:03:57.603 --> 00:04:00.506
If any more news from 2016
breaks throughout the night,

00:04:00.506 --> 00:04:02.675
we'll be sure to
keep you updated.

00:04:04.209 --> 00:04:06.912
How do you look at four years
of Trump and just now are like,

00:04:06.912 --> 00:04:09.082
"I'm starting to think
this guy is nuts"?

00:04:09.082 --> 00:04:11.150
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:13.353
"You guys catching a vibe?"

00:04:15.387 --> 00:04:17.656 line:0%
Today, both Chuck Schumer
and Nancy Pelosi

00:04:17.656 --> 00:04:20.393 line:0%
called for Pence
to pursue the 25th Amendment

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:22.595 line:0%
and remove Trump from office.

00:04:22.595 --> 00:04:26.699
If that happened, we'd have
three presidents in 13 days.

00:04:26.699 --> 00:04:30.169
I love the idea of changing
presidents like movie Batmans.

00:04:30.169 --> 00:04:32.171
[ Laughter ]

00:04:32.171 --> 00:04:33.772
Let's get to some lighter news.

00:04:33.772 --> 00:04:35.841
I saw that Discovery
has confirmed

00:04:35.841 --> 00:04:38.978
the "Puppy Bowl" will go on
as scheduled this year.

00:04:38.978 --> 00:04:41.080
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:42.915 --> 00:04:46.018
"Phew," said absolutely no one.

00:04:46.018 --> 00:04:48.588
The "Puppy" --

00:04:49.955 --> 00:04:51.891
The "Puppy Bowl"
is the one event

00:04:51.891 --> 00:04:55.428
that brings every American
together to think, "Why?"

00:04:57.196 --> 00:04:58.598
And finally, in New Jersey,

00:04:58.598 --> 00:05:01.067
police responded to
a McDonald's parking lot,

00:05:01.067 --> 00:05:03.302
where chickens
were chasing customers

00:05:03.302 --> 00:05:05.404
and wreaking havoc.

00:05:05.404 --> 00:05:08.407
I think this explains why today
Trump released a message

00:05:08.407 --> 00:05:10.843
saying, "I love you chickens,
but it's time to go home."

